{"id":"wb-6-744","name":"指林寺大殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"指林寺大殿","text":"指林寺位于云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州建水县临安镇文庙社区，始建于元元贞年间，明清以降多次扩建重修。寺坐南向北，原有山门、大殿、后殿、两塔、牌坊等，现仅存大殿及牌坊。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8C%87%E6%9E%97%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":90388575,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90388575","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4342ae7aeb57b68e946c43a6.jpg","title":"指林寺大殿_-_航拍_-_2025-04-29_06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%8C%87%E6%9E%97%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF_-_%E8%88%AA%E6%8B%8D_-_2025-04-29_06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/%E6%8C%87%E6%9E%97%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF_-_%E8%88%AA%E6%8B%8D_-_2025-04-29_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​指林寺大殿航拍","width":320,"height":180}}